{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1193,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ed736199c506eb911055bc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天到了哦，食欲之秋！\r\n跑步的力气和食欲都高涨起来了，\r\n要吃得饱饱的，然后跑个痛快了哟～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "713b7a389dd375e39167b70ec2f516d701937ff2e1ad384c22d517355f02f8bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b7c0b02d4965a20959949c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我已经习惯了冬天上冻的路面了，\r\n所以就让我来领头吧！\r\n还请抓紧我的手哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8acee157a24de308935465f63ae4c9fcf66e72291d03ac167270f06f654fb671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43df100d2cc8bd2cb99d80c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4588e6096f8147846e4ba6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚我和丸善小姐\r\n搭上话了！\r\n果然是位优秀的人呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7cd271f9f80d1a310699d14ba8bc7c90fdd3997ebf7b222ca07ba8bbcf640e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6874319185a2d7ed31dfef5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从妈妈那里收到了很多\r\n蔬菜哦！\r\n这次也分点给训练员你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fca91f32e332c53536ada29022a0160fc5ef5a8cf753ef1a56442fd264163e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64ac5cb4383b3a350328de96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈欠…昨天一不小心就和\r\n铃鹿同学聊天聊到半夜了…\r\n诶嘿嘿，真开心啊～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7469f25069887b3bbe261a7bcc0b6c872a4781028a8c4d166bb9dc40af9d6be6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f5956d669307648f3666468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一想到饭堂的东西都很好吃，\r\n就会一不注意就吃很多呢～。\r\n诶嘿嘿…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc8b815732e06b359ed6f94e4e4bff7d5221185ab634767a3319bfd4e9efd5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b05bdeb22da61d886bd94ff7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园真的很大呢。\r\n我说不定不久后\r\n就会在学园里遇难了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87bb238339712c3b047a64bb46f10fe87adbfe805a02f4eb28f39e14aa2e4fab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:accf33884c2ce4ff6565d7fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚居然有后辈跑过来\r\n对我说『我是你的粉丝！』什么的！\r\n哈哇哇…没想到会有这种事呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c387a01f1c6709b1c23c9ce97da9fa590e1825ca7d23337ca1527bc027862a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29ee0c285e8c47a7b89ae443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要一穿上这套衣服，身体\r\n都轻快了起来！感觉就这样\r\n跑回北海道也没有问题…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5302dd732d5afd41d8fde06403ae4840effe13d4305627928c1045610e88748",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f77acc237c16c1b4e2c51b01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直至这件衣服成为日本\r\n第一的证明为止…！\r\n我都想继续奔跑下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62ead5cfa90ac9085a5afaf0166489c72ae22990beae6ee476d2fb626726d55a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc484ad8083d6f44736cc8b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给妈妈发了穿着决胜服的\r\n照片后马上就打电话过来了！\r\n嘿嘿…电话那头“哇哇！”地嚎啕大哭呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da52b46e17a6416a38a17ede60e28ff4b8e998a27c5e2c4334640e07c928eecc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9c546fc6afe2da2854191be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今早和小鹰她们一起\r\n晨练了哦！\r\n诶嘿嘿！感觉很清爽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52a33bbc9852e0758869fa234af3aaaedb7ec1cfdd9938a8586987dd9c59677e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dd9b80c557e2fbb016e6fea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜…上午上课的随堂小测\r\n没有及格～…！\r\n这下又要去请教小草了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5fd8fc5a27ad293a04a9956a6bce5658bd0c95d53260523f59863f1ea5cb05e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eff8cc1a9a0f47c7dcdfcb74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么一到晚上就会不自觉的\r\n想吃甜的东西呢…呜，\r\n胡萝卜在脑子里诱惑着我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb62be2096e5f1882be7dfc7ce741c1994de20e78ce3e2ebe19abb58726e84cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd8249b3df132a922e346f7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿…嚏！\r\n诶，为什么最近那么容易\r\n打喷嚏呢…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "73aeaf8c2e3c7ea96c51ff7f64ada16fa36ef65283de9a67580fd01a3077e6b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a52d731c6c66bf0ca873249",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗅嗅…咦，雨的味道…？\r\n这可真是能够缓解酷暑的\r\n恩惠之雨呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b450336513ff2f99b31a2bcf7922da279546bb37ed098b6d8c5cf802ce14518",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cac97351e32ac571c07e4bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到秋天就总有种\r\n寂寞的感觉呢。\r\n不知道妈妈身体还好吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d2656e14dfb135d40c39d957e2fc184862262278971a4ce4d433b6b20a03226",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af35f6a528c45f6e458f6b55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜…我可不会输给内地的冬天！\r\n虽然是这么想的，\r\n但、但该冷的还是会冷啊～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41bec19f50006091e996bb6c3b5547a84ba3a5308816039cb27b2168ef18a6e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cfa8ca1d245b8fb1931dfff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铃鹿同学不管是跑步还是游泳\r\n都很快呢…无论哪个方面我都得\r\n努力追上她才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "719c79a002a86ea3ec9c314bbda4967f46384d7dafaf050f4b3aa1b8a53ecbb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adff7a97c21a73a9b479341e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被小鹰叫去摔跤了…\r\n明明这又不是摔跤服～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df8d492ac91b8867b56358dc4259de328c101ac51872d628cee5fe96f1d90f93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adea7df4d250672d8fb81050",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次请丸善小姐来给我做\r\n舞蹈特训了！\r\n目标是领奖台的第1名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdbdc456fbb39211f7d0b1a516f1414c65e1041fcfbe604a6e76fc9928433a39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cfde4fbea9aac172185f17a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜，如果不注意的话…\r\n青酱就会乘机跑过来\r\n戳我的背～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "b56836686fc2c545a44ed47947831679936df84c9cab5ee476e2687750d76f44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e8a07cc72f0ec5d3381b52e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给妈妈发了穿着泳装的照片之后\r\n…寄来的胡萝卜就变少了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "05688210a158d9d10db21631203b2e8b22b2950cfc5cea37359823a38d8a9988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c15110e879ed2fe7ef2996b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起床后立刻去游泳的话\r\n就会特别清醒！\r\n有机会的话训练员也请尝试一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f02d0adf904b7875e7e193081659b3001beae9eaf67f04a86cccacee6048b93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47421a7aa08b0176ebcbd68d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阳光好刺眼～…！\r\n如果不涂防晒霜的话…\r\n会被晒伤的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c857379bcfd4b124cf18cb0dd758f1e0c2016fcdd2505f587198d8e58bdcb406",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1160b27e0fd58b24e5b35d24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你问我肚子会不会冷？\r\n放心吧！我有妈妈\r\n给我准备的腹卷！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ccdd268ca83992b37de45ddd5731f84a6c627241c2c6e4c5df3e27f4e7fdc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a748f7a6f436c36eeaaeadac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一边游泳一边赏花…\r\n同时也可以起到锻炼的作用，\r\n我觉得很不错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64fb85cf7e4b832e3ce5a54fdab224595f96af296daa49db959dfa881cfb4d58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f64f17ccacd618d536a99f33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "泳池也好烟花也好夏日\r\n祭典也好…！为了让这个夏天\r\n不留遗憾，全都好好享受吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b30c824cdf0afd3cf28879d543ef89085ef6bc27bd7ba1303fa88c59ada9c0a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83a48e16ddf50d4e3aa733f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "团子、烤番薯、南瓜布丁…\r\n不行，不忍住的话！\r\n因为这件衣服，肚子会很明显…",
      "source_fingerprint": "16c6d70a8fab63f35ea965f5aee5ded3c7492f0783259be25cc04ecec924d820",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e41d19903ddb0469f88e17f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来以为已经习惯了，但穿成\r\n这样果然还是有点…阿嚏！\r\n还是有点冷啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4285a5aa5657e561986b029f98f75f4fb64ce43a7db0eb14f18b8e2c66a906a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43e610cdf3d4678e55517e59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时何地都要全力以赴！\r\n尽情享受跑步游泳的\r\n乐趣吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7c2e07e820350fbd89333732bfa18384ddd13dd2754b3828321f9a75edc8d39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4283116a7aa5e29114bc8d62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿着它心情\r\n就像在放暑假一样！这样就能好好\r\n享受度假的气氛了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca006e4531702971d559ea5e6178db4aa34f2496c093e5bf4a70191112ae8057",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a474a356230f3158c29b877f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然可能只有一点点，\r\n但是我也有向着“能够自豪地站在妈妈们面前的赛马娘”的目标\r\n稍微接近了些吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08e5c0f01e804e344f94bcc94f346ee307c224730163aae287963a5ef5e576f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed50aa4c54bc92abdbe7a980",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“这件决胜服好像很适合拿着\r\n刀剑呢”，小草她这么说了哦……\r\n也就是很帅气的意思对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb19d219ee8e7c89108e837e2ffa58202defa97c8a4b2b3815b484b07679a60f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54513401d61e87f04945785f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鹤丸她虽然伤病不断，\r\n但是一直都开朗地拼命努力着……\r\n我可不能输给她啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "486907499354ceaf411a7235b3f26e0bbd47ee32f0461c61b98b229b9fa1b6e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6738a9c8722f34a2882dcc69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "职业摔跤比赛真厉害呀～！\r\n在这之后就因为和小鹰聊上头\r\n错过了宿舍的门禁时间呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "549c94c6c7c9ee98f2c7b1f917a1785301bed6f9475b1dfee03ef4c31efc34a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1333e492b8482e35c28151ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前偶然看到了数码同学笔记本里的\r\n内容，居然连关于我的报道\r\n都被她做成了剪报……好高兴啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e016d2c41ba1e5147cf67c2561ef4d4fccb7884caa06da3987fab2a0f2e3fc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de52ae479e70a056bbc2956c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜～不被小圣王提醒我都没发现自己头发睡得乱糟糟的！\r\n这样子怎么配得上这件决胜服嘛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4147ff1d493b41f93141650d8916d844a41f40aca320dd5116fcda55b2ff3b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07eb3c03367a35e5525ac03b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以日本第一为目标的话，就得要文武双全。\r\n不仅脚力充沛，在学习上也要出类拔萃……\r\n我在课上真的学到了很多呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4f3822062ac27c4e404c5f3ee48c4c9dace6560222f54df4ea1884b331ea93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bce70631f0bb8769be7a61dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近老是会梦到关于比赛的梦呢。\r\n“我拿下了冠军、大家都为我高兴”——\r\n这一切绝对，会让它成为现实的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5b981ea7fed1eb845da8dde8e843388773bbe6ad4b498969a6eb6535d10c6a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c82f4769103294e26a3003e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是牛奶很好喝的季节哟～！\r\n作为北海道的宣传赛马娘，\r\n可要努力宣传家乡才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cada754cf8d63d78cadb541e092e25267b662218dce52a6f377b687f2e8b2354",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f530b4edfeafc926238a30a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "沙滩排球和潜水，还有还有……\r\n总之就是好好玩乐，\r\n一起制霸夏天吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3af41b2a9ca6cc6086a7d39b583623fe3a8094522b3e853c80bf9ee70ab75a5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0564ea2d28c6c3643e9a2496",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "防波堤钓什么的真有意思啊～！\r\n我和小青一起钓到了很多秋季才有的鱼哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "43592e61e7187a5e32c30c4ac9aadeec33e9dfbeaf0e703d1cfcba7d312294c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f221b886b58dddfe389cbd00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直都很想堆一次雪屋呢～\r\n老家附近的雪，散散的很难堆起来呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38ebcd357b4d6c62a6df59a39fbf8adf450a06248ddfd87b932662a4d8ceb5f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c98588980f0bcba8cf284091",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，吾乃日本第一的\r\n特别周总大将是也～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc4a264b34f6306cb8640a0fec381576cc7bba6605a08232df927c42fcbc8f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc192b606056d151a3ae7805",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家的思念就是我的锦之御旗……\r\n从今以后，我也会和这件决胜服一起继续赢下去的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae6069ef1eb7d4e34ffa88e758f9846ac6f0ab1dca70ee5dbfc56a888fddd327",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:027ec7305008d10aaf19bd7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要做什么？\r\n不管是什么训练我都会加油的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ea1b0ee7cd488619cfd5602af44e58cb3ad2d45259ef081a52adf04aa504201",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2826425351f5768c59e64044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきますっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0ee723306ea339f8c53c617bbeb0d8bbc8544bca51ccba4a801db3248f22b95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f909e12f36bb8d1e70556d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好ー，要加油咯ー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90363ac0f9e8c24824501626c55fc9e78ee98606d7738cf1d615e86a458c2d35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f0aec366f63d1de5cde9a8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鞋子的状态、没问题！\r\n伸展训练、没问题！\r\n随时都可以开始训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27c74e16c4f9352de2fa98546bf293f195ab32ff77509f2d68ca916bd380078b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac2f586e2c8e00130391df21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，\r\n请下指示吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "032aa8a589d1ce8d33f16647404cbab90b96ae17b549e7e0e0b2b085e2a8a42f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9263c94e5f8bf74efd75c05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我变强了的样子，真想早点让\r\n妈妈也看到啊…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa8c1bdf0bb1b9083fadf3805d4cd2a466a941a52f4128e3e0131e529c1c7a77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8296d7973f01e8ca1b12230b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大家跑得都很快…\r\n但我也不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "010cdfbab197cbc2d0496c6f356bfe8cafb8d1b21cfec8c14f454eca50bba817",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a5bec4c13cae89f353778cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还只是在逐梦的路上而已！\r\n为了能够变得更加强大，\r\n还请多多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9eeacdc14cf56a38d1ac47eae872dc4d24ff680513d202bf2c85383a994abd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8224b56cb762ad182af4764",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了赢得比赛，我要好好地\r\n锻炼自己！！\r\n请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e17db5d5d4775593a74373feecd699825db3c664ae82b8f908f03fa894a37195",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b89c4548053ac53ad4b73dfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "激浪般地前进吧ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd43a3cbad092c4cd535d233b66cf69f26ebc45c2f63d8acc82d6aa38e06406c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada1c308f76cf647d4e5d82b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更为精进的轻盈姿态，\r\n就请好好见证吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2579f25fd34ac7629a5fdded5080066d428976d9a11970b0ff8e07772df7f331",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a38501c05dd2467cdfbd3b8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像太阳一般热烈，我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26ee0719312acef19babfa6758b495fc60047647737cd0a0df2a3a34b13dfd75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8070199b0aab8d274a2a0bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's Go Go♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "69b92b01e86debd0016782ccc65c12977b83ae7097012511634d7c5251266c8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:791d6ba6e0ef5249dac57aa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体好轻…\r\n感觉好像什么都能做到♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d016f2c44655b4923aa330b35f7c0cbf6cae293fab184c6a96659bca4759046",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a75bf09848ac7d64f2c55649",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管天气有多热，\r\n只要跳进泳池里…\r\n就立马能够凉快下来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2cd67a93f3f850062fa61b7407ba73ecc97e70360711fb4c279fb1ab040243",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167a4f566bda82d8b30cf332",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是怎样的试炼，\r\n我都能够乘风破浪！现在的我，\r\n就算是鄂霍次克海的骇浪也不在话下！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cceebc2b1bf3c8a0cf8c96a55da59645b81cb41ba04e6295072d7d7dac482066",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83d4d0498281adde14440a87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么！为了向着梦想继续努力，\r\n今天也好好加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84bb82b564124ec2a6091deb3d0d176d3a9e5abc80965f83abb6e2ac91eace16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b0f0fe3a056513ba586ba11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一起在赛场上取得天下吧！\r\n梦想也会“咚咚”地变大的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca6a87caf2c658f1196d9ba8683b46d73a6318d9860502ea3800d659690daaa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bad5804742389bb6c7d0fa15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要进行什么训练呢？是要冲坡道，\r\n还是说要锻炼肌肉呢？为了补充营养\r\n先吃饭也是没问题的哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b95c974a054a0b7b9f4c15c9310930daedfe782ad978d1ced9821a2047d290cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:475dad71c470c1b945a5231c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是怎样的训练都放马过来吧！\r\n毕竟如果要以日本第一为目标的话，\r\n可得要样样精通呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e4871b13467902272fda416895e8cc93550c0f93c45bd291ef3ad37777a688",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89a481b0cf15ecca4c709d89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了有训练员在，\r\n我终于明白我想要成为的“日本第一”\r\n是怎样的了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a89da993951c9a7740c74e3893c67c3baff79c2c323cb8f71abe07f5934bf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b44e305e0cbf4a7b6be91d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最大的敌人，就是想要放弃的心……\r\n不过，只要跟训练员在一起的话，\r\n就能够一心向前跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "305df363a46c0b288f57e19834a9000c7f6df336a079c964a3740576c702ab5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d63b8a238285f7a1e379a831",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员的梦想，\r\n我也会好好地承载并跑下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f198813752f82a411ce2e1dad214c10916dfe47a3ba2a3aa5b2476c3a77b8322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e721c7f3ecf242cba4daf7a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有成为训练员的骄傲吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab49f8dbe081b53a5340ef559b9aeb855ea7390bc3a99bee21ffd52939172d0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e40721b855431b822d7da2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这下能够自豪地向母亲报喜了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b62c4c95524da121eaca80dfdf11ba6a022a46041881058e1eba6b7ca9394a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcdb244484590e9dcdd5620f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在也好、未来也好…\r\n继续热情地闪耀吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "462b026889f088bcda8b4094d437c54a8879006b3dc74a6c89a82d5c174cf625",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10245b180e08974470112b3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这些日子成为了我无可替代的回忆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8a5ba0915313e56bcf8c024496be117c81c6ff95a9f47c53aecd6073b36d4a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb074778984f7f7e7ce1932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的训练员可是日本第一棒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfec9d48aaea167db1c2938941dffa692d1bb3209e6585c04e01ec4edcfa2f22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9d0b7b202c81e7a31302177",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“特别”的梦想，已经被我紧紧抓住了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dea32366c4f165faf0dabbd0a728a8fd5474dcf1187bc4ca88860dc568dbe787",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f733b26af9bff2fb7817ea53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，力量从身体里涌出来了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f753f51eb5d61cfcdcdab9c5a2f90dddbc00165d1cd364aaebad98ee346cbf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82a1192e8ed880c36ff91334",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还能变得更强…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f20ff43e6e6dbf7ac5ba5698119697ff9cc36ba52ea1d46cc06bd7375a7b772a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c1dcd046eac0aa6f20f6cbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，我是特别周！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d7e44aedae3f12f459bb47b88d57c3618e3ac4bb35b70021b412b269304828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffb6bc73863f1131c340b12b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能够成为值得骄傲的自己！\r\n我…会赢得胜利的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73a81dd4584283af44667dff6f595bb72802016ed4aa8d58d70c3a79c3706f0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
